  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// ── Doors. `hinge:` picks the jamb by the segment's draw direction and</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// `swing:` the side the leaf opens toward — `left` is the left of the pen's</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// travel, so on these east-running walls it opens north. The chrome is</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// generated: a leaf at 90° open plus its quarter arc, two mirrored halves for</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// `double`, and two overlapping panels for `sliding`, which hangs no leaf. An</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// opening's own text is its **schedule tag**, seated beside the gap on the</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// face the leaf never sweeps — the last cell wears one.</span>
